# SSMG CROSSHAIR, SEQUENCE INDEX IS 33 NOT 32
AddBlockElements Sequences
AddBlockElements Sequences[*].Sprites
SetField Sequences[*].Name "ssmg"
SetField Sequences[*].BitmapCount 1
SetField Sequences[*].Sprites[0].BitmapIndex 32
SetField Sequences[*].Sprites[0].Right 1
SetField Sequences[*].Sprites[0].Bottom 1
ImportBitmap 32 workingdir\bitmaps\HUD_Reticles\32.dds
SaveTagChanges
Exit

